This policy applies to the University’s Global Campuses, to the extent that it is compatible with the 
local law applicable of that Campus, and not inconsistent with the Global Campus Agreements, as 
applicable, from time to time. 
5. DEFINITIONS  
(Note: Commonly defined terms are located in the Curtin Common Definitions. Any defined terms below are 
specific to this document). 
Artificial Intelligence or AI 
An engineered system that generates outputs such as content, forecasts, recommendations or 
decisions for a given set of human-defined objectives*. 
* This policy adopts the definition of AI system from the International Organization for Standardization 
ISO/IEC 22989:2022.  
6. SUPPORTING PROCEDURES  
Procedures are to be developed, implemented and refined by the University in support of the AI 
Guidance Principles.  
7. RELATED DOCUMENTS/LINKS 
