 Study
 Gen-AI
 Use
Using Gen-AI
A skilled Gen-AI user should, as put by librarian Kyle Bylin from at
Saginaw Valley State University, have “the ability not just to
use these tools, but to collaborate with them, to shape
them, to direct their generative power toward genuinely
meaningful discovery and creation”.
For an increasing number of individuals, AI technology is already
playing a role in their professional and personal lives and will
continue to do so. As we learned in the Understand section, this
technology is powerful but must be used thoughtfully to avoid AI
slop.
Before looking closely at how to use Gen-AI, there are two
important issues to understand: privacy and copyright. Expand
the sections below to learn more.
Before use
Introduction
Understand
Unpack
Upskill
Declare and Reference
Privacy considerations

Use

