… (3) in a way that shows you have
thought critically about its output.
Gen-AI cannot check facts or think critically, so you must
always review its outputs against trusted sources, even if the
response sounds professional and convincing.
Keep a critical mindset by cross-checking information,
confirming that references are real, and remembering that
your own judgment and expertise are more valuable than any
AI tool.
Make sure you understand how Gen-AI tools work.
