Bundle page 25 | A006 | source page 4 | line numbers at left","This step is about making sure Gen-AI’s output is accurate
and trustworthy. Gen-AI can sound confident, but it often
includes mistakes, bias, or outdated information. It cannot think or
fact-check—that is your job.
You should ask yourself:
Have I compared the output with what I already know or
checked it against a trusted source?
Click here to learn more
Make It Yours:
This step is about staying in control of your work. You are the
author, and Gen-AI is just a tool you guide.
You should ask yourself:
Have I used Gen-AI to support my ideas and perspectives,
not replace them? Does the final product feel like I
produced it?
Click here to learn more
