h is precisely defined such as 2:00pm (1400) on a specific date."", ""L021"": ""2.4 If late submission of work is excluded, any work submitted after the specified due dates and"", ""L022"": ""times will be considered late and will receive a penalty of 100% (i.e. a zero mark for the"", ""L023"": ""Assessment component that was late for a grade/mark Assessment or an F for a Pass/Fail"", ""L024"": ""Assessment)."", ""L025"": ""2.5 If late submission of work is accepted, and the student does not have an approved Assessment"", ""L026"": ""Extension, a penalty will be applied as follows:"", ""L027"": ""Submission Reduction"", ""L028"": ""The mark is reduced by 5% of the total marks"", ""L029"": ""Up to 24 hours late"", ""L030"": ""allocated for the assessment item."", ""L031"": ""The assessment mark is reduced by 5% of the"", ""L032"": ""total marks allocated for the assessment item for"", ""L033"": ""the first 24 hours it is late."", ""L034"": ""Beyond 24 hours late, up PLUS"", ""L035"": ""to 168 hours late (7 days)"", ""L036"": ""The assessment mark is reduced by a further"", ""L037"": ""10% of the total marks allocated for the"", ""L038"": ""assessment item for each additional 24 hours"", ""L039"": ""period that is commenced."", ""L040"": ""Beyond 168 hours late A mark of zero is recorded."", ""L041"": ""2.5.1 All penalty timeframes will be inclusive of weekends and public holidays."", ""L042"": ""2.5.2 Assessment events (e.g., exams, performances) will be scheduled in the Teaching"", ""L043"": ""Weeks specified in the Unit Outline. Students will be given a minimum of 10 working"", ""L044"": ""days’ notice of the date and time. Failure to attend without an approved extension will"", ""L045"": ""result in a Mark of zero (0) or an F for Pass/Fail Assessments. A student who is late"", ""L046"": ""to an Assessment event may be permitted to complete the Assessment within the"", ""L047"": ""original timeframe for the event but will not be permitted extra time."", ""L048"": "