nt time zones"", ""L032"": ""commencing Mauritius 09.00 the duration of the examination"", ""L033"": ""(two hours)"", ""L034"": ""Example 1 (Row 2 of above table): Two examinations are supplied as the examination is scheduled at"", ""L035"": ""different times within the same time zone. The examination papers consist of five short answer questions,"", ""L036"": ""and both examine the required learning outcomes. In each case, whilst the topics examined are similar"", ""L037"": ""(and therefore consistent), the question wording is different."", ""L038"": ""This would be considered to be a ‘sufficiently different’ examination paper, because a student who obtained"", ""L039"": ""knowledge of the content of the earlier examination would not be advantaged."", ""L040"": ""Example 2 (Row 3 of above table): Two examination papers are supplied as the examination is scheduled"", ""L041"": ""at the same time but across different time zones. The papers are very similar with minor occasional"", ""L042"": ""changes to numerical values used within the question."", ""L043"": ""This would not be considered to be a ‘sufficiently different’ examination paper, because a student who"", ""L044"": ""obtained knowledge of the content of the earlier examination would gain an advantage."", ""L045"": ""Assessment and Student Progression - Policy and Procedures Page 100 of 100"", ""L046"": ""G50-746-23"", ""L047"": ""March 2026 (admin)""}","Assessment and Student Progression - Policy and Procedures 
