CHECKLIST TO UPHOLD ACADEMIC INTEGRITY 
Refer to this checklist before submitting your assessment tasks. Some unit coordinators also may 
require an assignment cover sheet where you must declare that the work is your own, note any use of 
Gen-AI tools, and confirm it is free of unauthorised materials. 
 
Make sure you have: 
 
Tick Box 
Action 
Explanation 
 
Obtained permission before using any Gen-AI tools 
Checked the assessment details for permission and 
