(a) 
an enrolled student as deﬁned in section 4(1) of the Act;  
(b) 
admitted, or applying to be admitted, to a Course or Unit conducted by the University; or  
(c) 
engaged, or applying to be engaged, in a structured program of learning provided by or for the 
University. 
Student Conduct Appeal Panel means the panel constituted in accordance with Schedule 2 of these 
Rules. 
Student Conduct Panel means the panel constituted in accordance with Schedule 1 of these Rules. 
