Schedule 1 – Student Conduct Panel 
1. 
Student Conduct Panel members 
1.1 
The members of a Student Conduct Panel will be appointed by the Academic Registrar.  The members 
will be: 
(a) 
The Student Conduct Panel Chair – who may be any person appointed by the Academic 
Registrar. 
(b) 
A Staﬀ Member. 
(c) 
A Student. 
2. 
Quorum and voting 
2.1 
Quorum for a Student Conduct Panel is the Student Conduct Panel Chair and one other member.  
2.2 
Decisions are to be made by majority.  In the case of a tied vote, the Student Conduct Panel Chair has 
a casting vote. 
 
 
 
