Schedule 2 – Student Conduct Appeal Panel 
1. 
Student Conduct Appeal Panel members 
1.1 
The members of a Student Conduct Appeal Panel will be appointed by the Academic Registrar.  The 
members will be: 
(a) 
The Student Conduct Appeal Panel Chair – who may be any person appointed by the Academic 
Registrar. 
(b) 
A Pro Vice-Chancellor (or their delegate). 
(c) 
A Student. 
2. 
Quorum and voting 
2.1 
Quorum for a Student Conduct Appeal Panel is the Student Conduct Appeal Panel Chair and one other 
member 
2.2 
Decisions are to be made by majority. 
 
 
