3.5 
USE, SHARING AND DISCLOSURE 
a) Data and information will be handled according to its sensitivity as determined by its 
Information Security Classification (see Information Security Classification Toolkit). 
b) The University, through the FOI Coordinator, is to comply with requirements to release 
information under the Freedom of Information Act 1992 (WA), with the exception of Global 
campuses who must comply with any local requirements in their country with regards to 
freedom of information.  
c) The University community will comply with the Privacy Procedures and/or Disclosure of 
Personal Information Procedures with regards to using, sharing or disclosing any personal 
or sensitive information to any individual, entity or other third party under contract, 
collaboration, licence, project or agreement or other relevant situation.  
