and information that sits outside of our Information Security Classifications, 
such as data and information from government agencies which require the 
application of the Australian Government’s Protective Security Policy 
Framework (PSPF) for data and information assessed as Security Classified. 
 
The University will retain and dispose of data and information in accordance with 
the applicable Retention and Disposal Authorities, legal requirements, business 
need and risk appetite. 
 
Responsibilities and accountabilities are outlined in the Information Management 
Procedures. 
