sk appetite, and legislative environment."", ""L022"": ""3.1.5 Information Assets will only be accessed, used and/or shared for the approved"", ""L023"": ""purpose of the Information Asset in accordance with supporting University policies and"", ""L024"": ""procedures (including the Disclosure of Personal Information Procedures). Any"", ""L025"": ""proposed changes to an Information Asset will consider the security of the asset."", ""L026"": ""3.1.6 Any security incidents affecting an Information Asset, such as where access to an"", ""L027"": ""Information Asset is unavailable, where the Asset been modified in an unauthorised"", ""L028"": ""manner, or where exposure of the Asset is contrary to its information security"", ""L029"": ""classification will be reported to the IT Security and Assurance team."", ""L030"": ""3.2. Appropriate use of ICT Assets"", ""L031"": ""3.2.1 ICT Assets will be used for authorised purpose(s) only, such as official University"", ""L032"": ""business or University approved research and development, and limited Personal"", ""L033"": ""Use."", ""L034"": ""3.2.2 Users will act in a manner which complies with the University’s values, relevant"", ""L035"": ""legislation, statutes, rules and applicable policies and procedures."", ""L036"": ""3.2.3 University staff will monitor, inspect and review the use of ICT Assets."", ""L037"": ""3.2.4 Users will not upload, download, install and or distribute unlicenced or inappropriately"", ""L038"": ""licensed software."", ""L039"": ""3.3. Password security"", ""L040"": ""3.3.1 Information used to access Information Assets (such as passwords, personal"", ""L041"": ""identification numbers, passcodes and biometric information) will be protected. A User"", ""L042"": ""will not disclose University passwords to anyone, unless:"", ""L043"": ""• the User (e.g. Information Asset Administrator) is issuing a new password; or"", ""L044"": ""• the disclosure is approved by the Chief Information Officer, or their au