tion,"", ""L021"": ""including making serious allegations, then declining to provide further information"", ""L022"": ""or evidence about the allegations;"", ""L023"": ""• changing the substance of an existing complaint or re-phrasing allegations while"", ""L024"": ""the complaint is being managed;"", ""L025"": ""• refusing to provide further clarification of issues raised upon request, particularly"", ""L026"": ""where large amounts of information are presented as part of the complaint; or"", ""L027"": ""• repeatedly emailing or calling the University despite being advised not to do so"", ""L028"": ""because the subject matter of their complaint is currently being dealt with or has"", ""L029"": ""already been dealt with and resolved."", ""L030"": ""3.5.4. The University may restrict access to its complaints service for complainants who act"", ""L031"": ""unreasonably."", ""L032"": ""3.5.5. The Vice-Chancellor will inform the complainant in writing that they have deemed the"", ""L033"": ""complainant’s conduct to be unreasonable and the University will therefore not be"", ""L034"": ""processing it further."", ""L035"": ""3.6. Protecting parties to a complaint"", ""L036"": ""3.6.1. It is a breach of this procedure to threaten, intimidate, harass or victimise any party"", ""L037"": ""who makes, assists in or is responsible for the resolution of, or is the subject of, a"", ""L038"": ""complaint. Any such behaviour may result in individuals being subject to disciplinary"", ""L039"": ""action or, in extreme circumstances, reported to the appropriate external regulatory"", ""L040"": ""body or the police."", ""L041"": ""3.6.2. The University acknowledges that a complaint that appears to lack plausibility, or after"", ""L042"": ""investigation is not substantiated, is not necessarily false. A complaint that is not"", ""L043"": ""upheld does not imply the complaint was not made in good faith and that an avenue is"", ""L044"": ""automatically created for the respondent, the University or anyone else to take reprisal"", ""L045"": ""action against the complainant; however, this does not preclude any individual from"", ""L046"": ""lodging a legitimate complaint against another individual at any other time."", ""L047"": ""3.6.3. The University recognises the power imbalance, in particular, between students and"", ""L048"": ""staff, and between staff and their line manager, which may provide opportunities for"", ""L049"": ""reprisals to be taken against complainants in ways that may be difficult to expose. In"", ""L050"": ""such cases, the University may take steps to prevent disadvantage to a complainant"", ""L051"": ""as a result of them making a complaint in good faith. These necessary steps may"", ""L052"": ""include, among other things, temporarily physically relocating an individual, changing"", ""L053"": ""reporting lines, or assigning a different academic lecturer or supervisor to a student."", ""L054"": ""G50-746-276 3"", ""L055"": ""December 2024 (admin)""}","G50-746-276 
 
