In such cases, the complainant has a right to raise a new complaint, identifying where 
the University’s processes have not been complied with. The complainant can also 
refer the University’s handling of their complaint to an appropriate independent 
external body or tribunal such as the WA Ombudsman. 
3.4.4. Where requested, the ISU will advise the complainant in relation to these agencies 
