agreed outcomes. 
3.1.2. A transaction will not be split for the purpose of reducing the minimum requirements 
above.  Similarly, continued regular procurement of the same goods or services will 
be considered in the aggregate rather than piecemeal for the purpose of meeting the 
competitive requirements contained in these procedures. 
 
1 The total estimated cost of goods or services from a specific contract including any extension options, exclusive of GST; or total 
value of goods or services expected from a specific supplier in any one year should be used to determine the threshold and so 
which requirement must be met. 
