2.6. 
Specific risk management frameworks and risk appetites 
2.6.1. Process or function owners or Policy Managers may develop specific risk frameworks 
and risk appetites that are consistent with the RMF.  
2.6.2. Where a specific risk appetite is required, it will be included in the risk appetite for 
approval by the relevant Policy Manager or Vice Chancellor as required. 
2.6.3. Where required, Managers will assess, implement treatment action plans as required  
and monitor specific risks. 
