3.4.3 Where applicable, the University will collaborate in good faith to implement or develop 
protocols for implementing, in relation to ICIP, the Australian Institute of Aboriginal and 
Torres Strait Islander Studies Code of Ethics for Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander 
Research. 
