The drawing of cash without receiving, for each occasion, the prior written 
approval from the relevant Executive Manager; 
• 
Personal expenditure for any reasons; 
• 
Payment of any allowance as cash (e.g. for per diems/subsistence on business 
travel); 
• 
Purchase of goods or services for which approval has not been received, or for 
which no delegation is held; 
• 
Internal payments within the University for any reason whatsoever without the 
express approval of the Chief Financial Officer;  
• 
Payment of study fees for a staff member. 
