to recommend to the Minister suitable candidates for 
appointment to a vacancy or casual vacancy in the office 
of —  
 
(i) 
any member of the Council who is appointed 
under section 9(1)(a); or 
 
(ii) 
any member of the Kalgoorlie Campus Council 
who is appointed under section 21M(1)(a), (b) 
or (c); 
