21P. 
Delegation by Kalgoorlie Campus Council  
 
(1) 
The Kalgoorlie Campus Council may by resolution delegate any 
of its functions to —  
 
(a) 
any member of the Kalgoorlie Campus Council; or 
 
(b) 
a committee of persons appointed by the Kalgoorlie 
Campus Council; or 
 
(c) 
any other person. 
 
(2) 
The Kalgoorlie Campus Council may by resolution revoke a 
delegation given under this section. 
 
(3) 
