22A. 
Terms used 
 
 
In this Division —  
 
advance determination means an advance determination 
granted under section 22H; 
 
approval means an approval granted under section 22I; 
 
commercial arrangement means any of the following —  
 
(a) 
a company; 
 
(b) 
a partnership; 
 
(c) 
a trust; 
 
(d) 
a joint venture; 
 
(e) 
an arrangement for sharing profits; 
 
(f) 
an arrangement for sponsorship; 
 
commercial purpose means obtaining income for the University 
through the leasing of University land, if the land is not leased 
for the purposes of the University or a purpose that is incidental 
to the purposes of the University; 
 
lease includes sublease; 
