General Act 2006 
 
(1) 
Subject to subsection (4), the provisions of the Financial 
Management Act 2006 and the Auditor General Act 2006 
regulating the financial administration, audit and reporting of 
statutory authorities apply to and in respect of the University 
and its operations. 
 [(2) 
deleted] 
 
(3) 
Notwithstanding the Financial Management Act 2006, the 
financial year of the Council shall end on 31 December. 
