Institutions Superannuation) Act 1985 or a contributor for 
pension, superannuation or benefits under the Superannuation 
and Family Benefits Act 1938 2. 
 
[Section 30A inserted: No. 77 of 1985 s. 7; amended: No. 96 of 
1986 s. 11.]  
