make regulations prescribing all matters that are required or 
permitted by this Act to be prescribed, or are necessary or 
convenient to be prescribed for giving effect to the purposes of 
this Act. 
 
(2) 
Before making a recommendation under subsection (1), the 
Minister must consult with the Council. 
 
[Section 34A inserted: No. 32 of 2016 s. 38.] 
