ts and will be"", ""L041"": ""available electronically through the Library. Learning resources that students choose to purchase"", ""L042"": ""will be available regardless of study mode or location."", ""L043"": ""2.7 The University Librarian (or nominee) will ensure the availability of essential learning resources"", ""L044"": ""which are made available electronically through the Library. Unit Coordinators will communicate"", ""L045"": ""where these electronic resources must be made available to global campuses."", ""L046"": ""2.8 Individuals will disclose all actual, perceived or potential conflicts of interest that arise from the"", ""L047"": ""prescribing of learning resources (particularly self-authored resources or where the individual may"", ""L048"": ""receive royalties) per the Conflict of Interest Procedures."", ""L049"": ""2.9 If a staff member believes a change to the prescribed principle learning resource/s for a unit is"", ""L050"": ""Course Quality Assurance Manual – Consolidated Policies and Procedures Page 51 of 83"", ""L051"": ""G50-746-426"", ""L052"": ""Published April 2026""}","Course Quality Assurance Manual – Consolidated Policies and Procedures 
