Responsibilities are as set out in Section 2. In addition: 
3.1 
The Manager, Curriculum Transformation will report annually to Courses Committee on the range 
and quality of Short Form Learning offered by Curtin and plans for improvement in design, 
approval or development processes. 
 
4. 
SCOPE OF PROCEDURES 
All students, staff and associates involved in learning and teaching, and all Curtin courses at all locations 
and Curtin Campuses. 
 
