semesters in the filter and click 'Refresh'.
If you are still experiencing difficulties with class registration, please contact Curtin Connect for
further assistance.
Class registration for 'fully online' units
No, you are not required to class register and create a class timetable if you are enrolled into
the 'fully online' attendance mode of a unit.
You can view the attendance mode of your currently enrolled units under the My Enrolment
tab in eStudent.
If you are studying through Open Universities Australia (OUA), you are also not required to
complete class registration as your studies will be undertaken online.
