Page 1 of 3
This form is designed to formalise open, and collaborative authorship discussions within a research team to assist 
the Corresponding Author in creating a formal record of the agreed arrangements and ensure researchers meet 
the requirements of the ‘Authorship, Publication and Peer Review Guidelines’ and ECU’s criteria for authorship. 
