Statement by the Corresponding Author

I am the Corresponding Author of the above publication and certify that all co-authors listed meet the criteria 
for authorship set out in 1.1.2 of ECU’s Authorship, Publication and Peer Review Guidelines and are in 
agreement and that no person entitled to authorship has been excluded without their agreement in writing.

This Authorship Agreement will be revisited if a project change necessitates this. 

The signatures above indicate that those listed are the only authors of the publication, that they have 
approved the version of the paper submitted for publication and the authors agree with the nomination of the 
Corresponding Author, all of which are in accordance with the Australian Code for the Responsible Conduct of 
Research, relevant legislation, guidelines and ECU policies and procedures.

The location of research materials and data is in alignment with the Data Management Plan for the project.

Any authorship disputes should be attempted to be resolved locally, then mediated through an Associate Dean 
(Research) or Research Integrity Advisor. 
