Contracted Service Providers
The University may engage Contracted Service Providers (third parties engaged under contract
to handle Personal Information on the University’s behalf) to handle Personal Information on its
behalf. The University remains responsible for Personal Information handled by Contracted
Service Providers and will ensure appropriate oversight and governance of such arrangements.
