May 2023:
A scheduled review of the policy was undertaken. There were no significant changes to the
policy or the policy position. Administrative updates were made to clarify and strengthen the
existing policy position and to reflect changes to the operating environment. These changes
include an updated definition of Strategic and School-Based Research Entities and a new link
to the associated webpage for related operational documents, a new clause at 4.13 to focus
attention on the Data Management Guidelines, a new clause at 4.21 to clarify authorship
expectations, strengthening of clause 4.27 to ensure clarity on research involving human
participants, strengthening of clause 4.28 to ensure clarity on research involving animals,
minor amendment to the wording of clause 4.49 to improve clarity, and an update to
operational document hyperlinks in Section 6 Related Documents.
17 June 2025: Vice-Chancellor approval of amendments (GDA25-001). Amendments include
