ing them that the"", ""L043"": ""Examination paper is “not endorsed” and explaining the reasons for the rejection."", ""L044"": ""The Student Administration Directorate is responsible for:"", ""L045"": ""receiving endorsed Examination papers submitted via OESS;"", ""L046"": ""returning papers to the Examiner via OESS if there is a concern about the quality or format of"", ""L047"": ""the papers;"", ""L048"": ""ensuring that all Examination papers are forwarded for printing under secure conditions;""}","All examiners and co-examiners must declare that an Examination complies with these
