ECU,N154,Assessment Procedure including Attachment 1,119,119,"L001, L002, L003, L004, L005, L006, L007, L008, L009, L010, L011, L012, L013, L014, L015, L016, L017, L018, L019, L020, L021, L022, L023, L024, L025, L026, L027, L028, L029, L030, L031, L032, L033, L034, L035, L036, L037, L038, L039, L040, L041, L042, L043, L044, L045, L046, L047","{""L001"": ""k.strampel@ecu.edu.au"", ""L002"": ""APPROVAL HISTORY"", ""L003"": ""Procedure approved by:"", ""L004"": ""Deputy Vice-Chancellor (Education)"", ""L005"": ""Date procedure first approved:"", ""L006"": ""June 2025"", ""L007"": ""Date last modified:"", ""L008"": ""December 2025"", ""L009"": ""Revision history:"", ""L010"": ""June 2025: Procedure created to support the Course Design Policy [PL282]."", ""L011"": ""18 December 2025: Policy Owner approval of amendments (GDA25-904). Amendments include"", ""L012"": ""revision of definitions to align across the Admission, Enrolment and Academic Progress Rules;"", ""L013"": ""the Academic Progression Policy Suite; the Credit and Recognition of Prior Learning Policy"", ""L014"": ""Suite; the Academic Misconduct Rules; the Academic Integrity Policy Suite; and the Course"", ""L015"": ""Design Policy Suite, along with minor amendments for clarity of intent."", ""L016"": ""Next revision due:"", ""L017"": ""December 2028"", ""L018"": ""Attachment 1: Assessment, Examination and Moderation Procedures"", ""L019"": ""Ensuring effectiveness of assessment"", ""L020"": ""Effective assessment comprises Valid Assessment, Reliable Assessment and Fair Assessment."", ""L021"": ""Effective assessment design must include consideration of the following key elements in order"", ""L022"": ""to certify achievement:"", ""L023"": ""Learning Outcomes - Learning Outcomes must be Valid, measurable, and aligned to the"", ""L024"": ""purpose of the Course and/or Unit."", ""L025"": ""Assessment Type - Assessment Types (selected in CAPS) must be an appropriate format and"", ""L026"": ""genre for Students to demonstrate achievement in relation to the Learning Outcomes being"", ""L027"": ""assessed. Generally, a variety of Assessment Types will be required across a Course to ensure"", ""L028"": ""all Learning Outcomes are assessed."", ""L029"": ""Assessment Task - Assessment Tasks must be developmentally appropriate to the stage of the"", ""L030"": ""Course, be conceived in meaningful relationship to each other and to assessment in related"", ""L031"": ""Units, and must clearly describe what Students are required to do."", ""L032"": ""Evaluation/marking system - Marking criteria must be explicitly aligned with Learning"", ""L033"": ""Outcomes being assessed and must align with Benchmarked Standards of performance."", ""L034"": ""Moderation - Moderation procedures must ensure Reliable judgement in relation to"", ""L035"": ""Benchmarked Standards during all phases of the assessment cycle."", ""L036"": ""Student Identity Verification - The identity of the Student completing the task (authorship)"", ""L037"": ""must be able to be verified."", ""L038"": ""Information for Students"", ""L039"": ""The assessment regime, including Assessment Types and weighting, as listed in CAPS and as"", ""L040"": ""shown in the Unit outline for that Teaching Period, cannot be varied after the CAPS publication"", ""L041"": ""deadline."", ""L042"": ""Assessment information for Students must be detailed in a designated location in the Learning"", ""L043"": ""Management System (LMS) and include details of:"", ""L044"": ""the Assessment Type;"", ""L045"": ""the Assessment Task requirements;"", ""L046"": ""the relevant Learning Outcome(s);"", ""L047"": ""the weighting;""}","k.strampel@ecu.edu.au
