Official webpage text reading copy | Retrieved 12 November 2026
Artificial Intelligence at Murdoch
Murdoch University is ready for the future with AI
In 2025, artificial intelligence is not just a futuristic concept—it’s a reality that’s transforming our
campus and community.
At Murdoch University, students are at the forefront of our decisions. Every step we take in
integrating Artificial Intelligence (AI) is designed to positively impact our students, ensuring they are
equipped with he tools to thrive in an ever-evolving world and use these skills to create a positive
difference across various industries.
Pioneering research and enhancing learning
Our groundbreaking AI research is making waves globally. From early detection systems for
bushfires to sustainable solutions that protect our planet, we’re using AI to make a real difference.
Imagine personalised learning experiences tailored just for you. Our AI tools are revolutionising
education, providing students with the support they need to excel and helping educators deliver
impactful lessons.
Staff training and community connection
We’re using AI to build a more inclusive and connected community. Whether it’s through smarter
campus services or innovative engagement initiatives, we’re ensuring everyone benefits from these
advancements.
The future of artificial intelligence is here, and at Murdoch University, we’re excited to shape how it
integrates into our lives and values. Together, we’re writing the next chapter of this incredible
story, and we invite you to be a part of it.
Don Klinger
Murdoch University
