1.7 Suspension 
1.7.1 
suspend the student from a course for one or more teaching 
periods to a maximum equivalent of one year, including suspension 
of current enrolment in all units. 
1.7.2 
suspend the student from use of or attendance at any or all of: 
university facilities, participation in university activities, access to 
assessment results, graduation and re-enrolment for a period up to 
12 months.  
2. 
The Vice Chancellor may impose: 
2.1 Exclusion or Expulsion 
2.1.1 
impose a requirement that the student refrain from having any 
contact with specified students, members of staff, or other 
members of the University community for any period of time. 
2.1.2 
prohibit use of or restrict access to university premises, university 
facilities and services or University activities for any period of time. 
2.1.3 
expel the student from the university.  
 
