4. 
How the University collects and holds personal information. 
4.1 Personal Information Collection Notices are generally provided at the time 
of personal information collection. 
4.2 The University’s website uses essential cookies to ensure core 
functionality. The University also uses non‑essential analytics and target 
cookies to improve performance and show more relevant content. These 
cookies do not identify an individual. Non‑essential cookies can be disabled 
in browser settings, but doing so may limit some site features. 
 
5. 
