5.6 Holders of Murdoch University email addresses 
5.6.1 
Names and email addresses are accessible via the University’s 
Microsoft 365 Global Address List. A staff member may access 
student contact details in this manner only for purposes related to 
the University’s functions. Students may access the contact details 
of other students only in connection with University activities.  
5.6.2 
Students able to hide their contact details from the other users. 
Students may opt to remove their contact details from the database. 
In doing so, they should first enquire as to whether, and to what 
extent, the removal of their contact details may adversely impact 
their involvement with University activities. 
 
6. 
Integrity of personal information 
6.1 The University will take reasonable steps to ensure that the personal 
information that is collected, used, stored, and shared is accurate, up to 
date and complete with the individual having a responsibility to inform the 
University of any relevant changes. 
 
7. 
Rights of Individuals 
7.1 An individual has the right to: 
7.1.1 
Request access to their personal information. 
7.1.2 
Seek correction of inaccurate or incomplete information. 
7.1.3 
Make complaints to the West Australian Information Commissioner 
if there is a belief that privacy rights have been breached. 
 
 
 
 
