3.  
How the University collects and holds personal information 
3.1 Personal Information Collection Notices are generally provided at the time 
of personal information collected. These Collection Notices: 
3.1.1 
Notify an individual: 
3.1.1.1 Whether the information is being collected under an 
Australian law or court/tribunal order; 
3.1.1.2 of any collection which an individual might not otherwise be 
aware of; or if it is being collected from someone else; or 
any secondary purposes for which it is being collected; and 
3.1.1.3 The main consequences for the individual if all or some of 
the personal information is not collected. 
3.1.2 
