this kind of information; and 
3.1.2.2 Whether the University is likely to disclose the information 
to overseas recipients, and if so, advise, if possible, the 
countries in which those recipients are likely to be located. 
3.2 Where practicable, access to personal information will be restricted to those 
staff members who may need the information to carry out their 
responsibilities. 
3.3 Information collected may be held in any form including: 
