3.3.4 
Computer chip-based memory 
3.3.5 
Cloud storage system 
3.3.6 
CCTV camera footage 
3.3.7 
Any electronic, magnetic or optical medium, such as computer 
disks or computer tape. 
 
4.  
Access to and correction of personal information 
4.1 All efforts will be taken to ensure that the information collected and held is 
complete, accurate and up to date. It is expected that an individual will 
assist by informing the University of any relevant changes. 
 
