12.2 Information Stewards must ensure reasonable steps are taken to manage 
the University’s information assets, regardless of media format. 
12.3 Information Custodians are responsible for implementing and monitoring all 
reasonable measures to manage the University’s information assets in 
accordance with this Policy. 
12.4 Information Users must ensure that the collection, use, storage, disclosure, 
and correction of personal information is carried out in compliance with this 
Policy. 
 
13.  Governance and accountability 
13.1 The University’s Privacy Officer oversees compliance with the Privacy 
Policy. 
13.2  Staff are trained in privacy and responsible information sharing obligations. 
13.3  Regular audits and reviews ensure ongoing compliance with the PRIS Act. 
 
