Adjudicator 
87. The appointment of an adjudicator will only be considered in an extreme 
circumstance where an examiner recommends A, as outlined in Regulation 85.1, 
and the other examiner recommends RR, as outlined in Regulation 85.2, and the 
two 
reports 
demonstrate 
a 
substantive 
