behalf against Australia's national security interests) must be familiar and 
adhere with the Foreign Interference Risk Mitigation Checklist (see Foreign 
Interference Policy). 
 
15. Complaints 
Staff who feel that their rights as articulated in this Code of Conduct have been 
breached can use the complaints process to seek remedy. 
 
