9 Compliance  
The University values constructive and collaborative relationships with its suppliers. 
Where issues arise, the University will work with suppliers to address concerns in a 
timely and proportionate way. This may include requests for information, corrective 
actions, or other reasonable steps to restore compliance. Failure to address material 
or ongoing non-compliance with this Code may affect a supplier’s ongoing relationship 
with the University. 
 
