Sprinkler protection is provided for the Harry Perkins Institute building where Murdoch’s ANPC leases space. 
Murdoch on-campus buildings are un-sprinklered but the new Boola Katitjin Building (Building 360) will be 
provided with sprinkler protection throughout. 
Special Extinguishing Systems 
The main data centre room on L1 of Building 245 is provided a total flooding fire suppression system activated 
with a double knock arrangement. There is an independent FM-200 system for the UPS room serving the 
data centre room facilities. 
Likewise, the server room in Building 390 is reportedly provided with a FM200 fire suppression system. 
