EFFECTIVE AS OF 01 JANUARY 2026 
 
APPLICABILITY 
1. 
In this regulation, the following words have the following meanings: 
1.1 “100 Level” means a unit with a unit code where the first numeral is 1. 
1.2 “200 Level” means a unit with a unit code where the first numeral is 2. 
1.3 “300 Level” means a unit with a unit code where the first numeral is 3. 
1.4 ""Award” means a Degree, Diploma or Graduate Certificate or other 
qualification covered by level 5, 6, 7, 8, 9 or 10 of the Australian 
Qualifications Framework. 
1.5 “Cancel” is defined as “cancellation” in the Enrolment Procedure. 
1.6 “Learning Outcomes” means the expression of the set of knowledge, skills 
and the application of the knowledge and skills a person will acquire and 
will able to demonstrate as a result of learning. 
1.7 “Quota” means a restriction on numbers of students that can enrol in a 
course, major, co-major, minor or Unit. 
1.8 “Required Unit” means a Unit that must be completed to complete a Course 
or Course Component. 
1.9 “Specified Electives” means a list of electives; a student may be required to 
complete a number of these to complete a Course or Course Component. 
1.10 “Unit” means the basic course component, comprising a structured and 
coherent set of learning activities and learning outcomes. 
2. 
These Regulations are made under Murdoch University Statute No. 4 - Degrees, 
Diplomas and Certificates. 
3. 
These Regulations apply to all Coursework Award Courses of the University. 
4. 
These Regulations prescribe the classification, nomenclature and structure of 
Coursework Award Courses of the University. 
5. 
These Regulations prescribe the titles of the Awards of the University. 
6. 
These Regulations prescribe the conditions under which a Coursework Award 
Course, recognised under the Australian Qualifications Framework (AQF), may 
be conferred as an Award of the University. 
7. 
These Regulations are to be read in conjunction with the following: 
Student Progression Procedure 
Governing academic monitoring and 
progression at the University. 
Coursework Regulations 
