Bachelor Honours Award Courses 
37. A Bachelor Honours Award Course incorporates a minimum of: 
37.1 12 credit points of Dissertation; and 
37.2 3 credit points of Research Training. 
38. A Bachelor Honours Award Course is structured as either: 
38.1 A discrete Course with a total credit point value of 24 that may be appended 
to a Bachelor Award Course; or 
38.2 Embedded within a Bachelor Award Course that has total credit point value 
of 96; or 
38.3 Embedded as a constituent Course of a Combined Bachelor Award Course 
that has total credit point value of 120; or 
38.4 Embedded as a constituent Course of an Integrated Award Course that has 
total credit point value not less than 120. 
 
