71. The completion time period is calculated from the first day of the first teaching 
period of enrolment to the last day of the last teaching period of enrolment for 
each Course attempt and is fully inclusive of periods of leave. 
72. Where a student reaches the maximum completion time period for a Coursework 
Award Course and has not satisfied the specified completion requirements the 
President of Academic Council may: 
72.1 Extend that student’s maximum completion period for a specified period 
subject to specified conditions; or 
72.2 Cancel the student’s enrolment in the course. 
