A staff announcement advises when the minutes are available. The 
minutes of Academic Council and Academic Council’s subordinate 
committees (Academic Courses and Admissions Committee, Quality 
and Standards Committee, and Student Experience Committee) are 
published on the web after they have been confirmed at the subsequent 
meeting.  
