8.2 Quality and Standards Committee 
The Quality and Standards Committee (QSC) is a subordinate committee of 
Academic Council. 
8.2.1 
Purpose: 
The Quality and Standards Committee monitors academic risk and 
assures compliance with relevant regulatory requirements. It provides 
oversight of quality and standards related to education and research, 
oversight of University review processes and related improvements in 
these areas. 
