11.2 Academic Council meeting dates 
Academic Council normally meets from 12.30pm on Wednesday afternoons. 
The Council meeting dates for this year are recorded at the following website: 
http://our.murdoch.edu.au/Committees/Academic-Council/Meeting-dates/  
It is advisable to record the time and dates in your diary/e-mail calendar. 
