as Chair of the Senate Committees, including providing advice and 
procuring legal advice as required; 
2.13.5.2. to work with the Senate, Chancellor and the Vice-Chancellor to 
establish and implement good governance practices; 
2.13.5.3. to manage all aspects of the meeting arrangements for Senate and 
Senate committees, including the coordination of the production and 
