University, after obtaining the approval of the Chancellor or Chair of the relevant 
committee.  This approval to be sought through the University Secretary.  The 
Chancellor or Chair, as the case may be, will identify any limits on consultations, 
and inform Senators of this. In seeking such advice, Senators may indicate the 
