Chair, access will be granted in order of the timing of notice given to the 
University Secretary under paragraph 4.5.7. 
4.5.9. The Chancellor may revoke any standing invitation issued at their discretion. 
4.5.10. A person who is not a Senator is not permitted to speak (unless invited to do so 
by the Chancellor). 
4.5.11. Observers can be excluded at any stage (either as a group, or individually) by 
decision of the Senate or of the Chancellor. 
