Our service standards
Our Accessibility Advisors and University staff endeavour to provide equity to all our students
through the best practice standards defined for education. These standards are set by the
Disability Standards for Education 2005 and the Commonwealth Disability Discrimination Act
1992 (DDA). The application of these standards at Murdoch University is defined in the Student
Disability Policy.
