clinical placement or internship. 
9.6 
Special consideration will not be granted where: 
9.6.1 
the student has completed the assessment task and their mark for it is consistent 
with their performance in assessment tasks in general, or 
9.6.2 
the student would not pass the course were special consideration granted, because 
their results in other assessments tasks have been such that a fail grade is certain. 
Applying for special consideration 
9.7 
Applications for special consideration must be submitted using the University’s online form 
for this purpose, either before or no later than three working days after the deadline for 
submission or scheduled date for completion of the assessment task and include supporting 
evidence of the exceptional circumstances that have caused them to need special 
consideration.   
