application, a respect officer’s confirmation that student has experienced adverse 
circumstances that warrant special consideration (see clause 9.9) and 
14.10.6 where they have decided the outcome of a student’s special consideration 
application, will inform the student and Student Administration team of the outcome 
(see clause 9.12). 
