15.1 
Interpretation 
15.1.1 The following rules of interpretation apply to this procedure: 
15.1.2 The University’s Policy Framework sets out the hierarchy of the University’s policy 
documents. 
15.1.3 Should any provision in this procedure be inconsistent with a provision of a document 
higher in the University’s hierarchy of policy documents as stated in the Policy 
Framework, the higher document prevails and overrules this procedure to the extent 
of the inconsistency. 
15.1.4 This procedure must be read alongside other closely-related policy documents: 
15.1.4.1 the policy that it supports, identified in the Purpose section 
15.1.4.2 closely-related policies and regulations listed in the Related policies and 
regulations sections 
15.1.4.3 the Employee Code of Conduct and Ethical Behaviour and Code of Conduct 
(Students), which include a requirement to comply with policy documents 
of the University, and 
15.1.4.4 any other documents listed in the Related documents section. 
