15.1.5.3 the words ‘include’, ‘includes; or ‘including’ followed by a list, the words 
‘without limitation’ are taken to follow immediately  
15.1.5.4 the phrase ‘for example’ or ‘such as’ followed by a single instance or list, 
the instance or list is not exhaustive 
