PURPOSE 
1.1 
This procedure supports the Policy: Assessment in Higher Education and Enabling Coursework 
Programs by stating requirements for assessment in: 
1.1.1 higher education coursework and enabling programs and courses, and 
1.1.2 courses with a supervised research component in bachelor (honours) and masters by 
coursework programs. 
1.2 
The Interpretation and definitions section at the end of this procedure: 
1.2.1 states requirements for interpreting this procedure and 
1.2.2 explains its hierarchical relationship with other policy documents in the University’s 
Policy Framework. 
1.3 
Scope 
1.3.1 This procedure applies to: 
1.3.1.1 assessment in all higher education coursework and enabling (tertiary 
preparation or pathway) programs and non-award higher education courses of 
