3.6.6 support students to understand assessment task requirements through engagement 
with assessment criteria and rubrics, exemplars demonstrating expectations and 
performance levels, and guidance about time management, and 
3.6.7 include early and formative assessments to provide mechanisms to identify students at 
risk and proactively provide additional support. 
3.6.8 All first level undergraduate courses and foundational postgraduate courses must 
include a formative or low-stakes task that is not onerous and enables students to 
receive meaningful feedback before census date.  
