19.2 In deciding the level of honours to be awarded to a student who has completed the 
requirements of a bachelor (honours) program, the board of examiners will apply: 
19.2.1 the process for calculating the award level stated in the program requirements 
document, and 
19.2.2 the classes of honours and mark ranges for honours decided by the school that manages 
the program. 
19.2.3 The following table is a guide to mark ranges and criteria for the possible classes of 
