19.2.3.1 A school may use these mark ranges and criteria, or different criteria and mark 
ranges for the classes of honours. 
19.2.3.2 The mark ranges in the table apply to the average final mark (with any 
weighting the school gives to specific courses) in the courses the school uses to 
calculate the classes of honours. 
 
