meanings stated below. 
27.2.1 Assessment method means the process(es) involved in accomplishing the assessment 
such as writing, performing, visualising, etc. 
27.2.2 Assessment mode means the manner in which the assessment occurs such as online, 
face to face, off campus. 
27.2.3 Assessment has the meaning stated in the Policy: Assessment in Higher Education and 
