3.4.2.5 act on suspected breaches when they are detected. 
3.4.3 Course coordinators, in addition to the requirements in 3.6.2, are expected to: 
3.4.3.1 ensure courses include learning activities and assessment that supports an 
educative approach to maintaining academic integrity 
3.4.3.2 design assessment tasks that are less likely to lead to breaches 
3.4.3.3 provide students with clear expectations for assessment, including the 
specific referencing requirements for the course 
3.4.3.4 provide students with access to text-matching software 
