Contract cheating
This is when a student submits uses a third party to complete part or all of their work for an
assessment and then submits it as their own work. This includes submitting work that has been
produced, contributed to, or modified by:
a commercial service provider
another student, (current or former student), a family member or a friend
software including generative artificial intelligence (unless expressly allowed), or
organising another person to complete an examination.
Other forms of breaches
There are other breaches of academic integrity. These include file-sharing, falsification/fabrication
