Appeal Process 
8.31 In the event a Respondent who is a staff member lodges an appeal of the findings or 
recommendations as to the disciplinary action of the Panel, the Vice Chancellor will refer the 
matter to an Employee Review Committee who will undertake a review for the Vice Chancellor 
in accordance with clause 47.4 of the University’s Enterprise Agreement 2022-2026. 
