6 
STORAGE, RETENTION AND DISPOSAL 
 
6.1 
Where possible, data and materials should be digitised, recorded in a durable and retrievable 
form, stored in institutionally sanctioned infrastructure (refer to the Research Data Storage and 
Access guide), appropriately indexed and described by metadata, and backed up. Where 
appropriate, metadata should contain the location of any physical object being digitised. Data 
