8 
DECOMMISSIONING OF DIGITAL STORAGE DEVICES 
8.1 
The Chief Information Officer will maintain instructions for staff to ensure that, before digital 
storage devices that contain licensed software and/or university information pass out of the 
University’s control, the devices are reliably erased or destroyed. 
9 
RETURN OR DELETION OF INFORMATION WHEN STAFF LEAVE THE 
UNIVERSITY 
9.1 
The Chief People Officer will ensure that the process to offboard staff who are leaving the 
University requires that they confirm that they have: 
9.1.1 returned to the University any hard copy or physical information that is classified as 
internal, sensitive or very sensitive, and 
9.1.2 transferred to appropriate storage or deleted any University data or information from 
all their own computers, mobile devices and removable digital storage media in 
