5.1.5 Any delegation which provides a Delegate authority to incur expenditure must be 
exercised within the limits of the relevant approved budget or other approved source of 
funds. 
5.1.6 A Delegate must not exercise a delegation in order to approve a recommendation made 
either wholly or partly by the Delegate. 
5.1.7 A delegation relates to a Delegate’s position, not to the individual occupying the position. 
An authority delegated under these Standing Delegations of Authority extends to: 
5.1.7.1 Any person acting officially in a Delegate’s position on an approved temporary 
basis (unless otherwise specified in the appointment to act); and 
5.1.7.2 The Delegate’s manager or other more senior staff member, where that manager 
or senior staff member has responsibility for the Delegate’s Accountability Area. 
