RISK MANAGEMENT APPROACH 
The University’s approach to risk management aims to ensure a structured, consistent and 
effective approach to Risk Management in line with the Australian Standard on Risk 
Management AS ISO 31000:2018. This approach is represented below. 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
Adapted from AS ISO 31000:2018 Risk Management –Guidelines 
 
3.1 
Communication and Consultation ensures that relevant stakeholders understand risk, the 
basis on which decision are made and the reasons why particular actions are required. 
