7 MANAGEMENT OF RISKS ASSOCIATED WITH MAJOR VENTURES 
7.1 
At the instigation of Executive Management, Risk Assessments are conducted as part of the 
planning and management of major ventures.  These may include projects, ventures, major 
events, agreements and commercial activities. 
7.2 
Responsible Executives or staff should monitor the Risk Treatment actions as appropriate. 
