Prior to seeking quotations for the supply of goods and/or services, check whether an 
Approved Supplier is available to provide the goods and/or services. 
4.1.3 
The number of written quotations required by the supplier is determined by the value of 
the purchase as set out in Schedule 1. 
4.1.4 
A copy of all quotations must be attached to any expenditure request and reasons for 
selection must be included in the Requisition. 
