15 RECORDS MANAGEMENT 
 
 
15.1 All staff are accountable for ensuring that a fully auditable transaction trail is in place for all 
Procurement activities - from identification of a requirement to approval, commitment, receipt 
and payment. 
15.2 Procurement is responsible for ensuring the documentation is maintained. 
15.3 All documents originating from a Procurement process, including, but not limited to, Planned 
Procurement, contract formation, and contract management will be recorded and managed in 
accordance with the Policy: Privacy. 
 
