4 
PRINCIPLES 
4.1 
All employees, affiliates, contractors, visitors, volunteers of the University have an obligation 
to ensure they, 
4.1.1 Behave honestly and with integrity. 
4.1.2 Act with care and diligence. 
4.1.3 Treat everyone with respect and courtesy, free from unlawful discrimination or 
harassment and in a way that maintains the dignity of each member of the University 
Community. 
4.1.4 Protect and respect the rights and reputations of other members of the University 
community including but not limited to other employees, students, Board members, 
volunteers, contractors, guest speakers and other members of the University 
