he External Reviewer is taken to have confirmed"", ""L022"": ""the original decision of the University."", ""L023"": ""5.6 If the External Reviewer makes recommendations in relation to an appeal, these"", ""L024"": ""recommendations will be provided in writing to the Head of Campus. The Head of Campus"", ""L025"": ""will:"", ""L026"": ""5.6.1 Implement any recommendations promptly"", ""L027"": ""5.6.2 Provide a copy of the decision to the Student and the Campus Registrar."", ""L028"": ""5.6.3 Should a matter be referred to an External Reviewer, the internal appeal"", ""L029"": ""process may be suspended pending the outcome of the External Review."", ""L030"": ""6 RECORD KEEPING"", ""L031"": ""6.1 The University will ensure that records of appeals and appeals outcomes are kept"", ""L032"": ""confidentially on the Student’s File and in accordance with the Policy: Privacy."", ""L033"": ""PROCEDURE: (VET) Student Appeals Page 4 of 6"", ""L034"": ""Effective Date: 11 March 2019""}","PROCEDURE: (VET) Student Appeals  
 
