records of common Administrative Functions in VIC 
 
4.3.1.2 
ISO Standards – these standards are a set of internationally recognised 
guidelines and specifications developed by the International Organisation 
for Standards (ISO) to ensure that products, services, and systems are safe, 
reliable, and of good quality. The ISO standards referenced in this 
framework are the following:  
4.3.1.2.1 
Australian Standard AS ISO 15489.1:2017 – This standard defines 
the fundamental concepts and principles of managing records. It 
applies to records in any format, structure, or technological 
environment, regardless of time.  
4.3.1.2.2 
Australian/New Zealand Standard AS/NZS ISO 30301:2020 – This 
standard specifies the requirements for establishing a records 
management system that supports the organisation in managing 
