DEFINITIONS  
8.1 
For the purposes of this Policy, the following definitions apply: 
Institutional Review Framework means the University’s principles and processes for 
institutional monitoring, review and improvement. 
Quality Assurance means processes and activities that ensure specified expectations and 
standards of performance and outcomes are met and enhanced where feasible. 
 
