4.2 
The University also operates within a legislative and regulatory framework that includes the 
following most relevant to academic governance:  
4.2.1 Tertiary Education Quality and Standards Agency Act 2011 
4.2.2 The Higher Education Standards Framework (Threshold Standards) 2021 
4.2.3 The Education Services for Overseas Students Act 2000 (ESOS Act) 
4.2.4 The National Code of Practice for Providers of Education and Training to Overseas 
Students 2018 (National Code) 
4.2.5 Standards for Registered Training Organisations (RTOs) 2015 
