ACKNOWLEDGEMENT OF CONTRIBUTIONS 
6.1 
A publication must contain appropriate acknowledgement of the contributions made by all 
participants in the relevant research, including the work of research students and research 
assistants, laboratory assistants, supervisors, participants, funders, Aboriginal and Torres 
Strait Islander knowledge holders, external collaborators, and any other persons providing 
