1.3.1.1 all coursework higher education programs and coursework courses of the 
University of Notre Dame Australia (the University), including non-award 
courses, English language preparatory courses and courses in foundation 
programs 
1.3.1.2 staff who prepare, approve and publish information about coursework 
programs and courses, and 
1.3.1.3 students enrolled in coursework courses. 
