9.9 
Faculty boards 
9.9.1 Faculty boards may approve variations to the course outline template for an individual 
course, for example in relation to: 
9.9.1.1 work integrated learning requirements 
9.9.1.2 extra course costs and fees to students and 
9.9.1.3 unusual requirements to pass a course (see clause 6.4.2 and its subclauses). 
