9.10.1 Heads of school may: 
9.10.1.1 in exceptional circumstances, approve a change to an assessment task stated 
in a course outline after the start of the relevant teaching period (see clause 
6.7.2 and its subclauses), and 
9.10.1.2 in exceptional circumstances, approve a change to a textbook listed as required 
in a course outline after the start of the relevant teaching period. 
9.11 Legal Office 
9.11.1 The Legal Office will review draft statements of programs’ inherent requirements (see 
clause 4.1.2.2). 
9.12 Library 
9.12.1 The Library will collaborate with the Office of Information Technology to ensure that 
learning management system course sites provide students with information and 
resources for which the Library is responsible (see section 6.10). 
