with the Assessment Policy.  This advice must be confidential and coupled with procedural 
information so that the student understands what occurs next. 
(g) A student or students alleged to have committed academic misconduct must be given a right to be 
heard by way of allowing them to attend an interview(Schedule 2 details the procedures to be 
followed). 
 
