University Policy on Academic Integrity 
Schedule 3 – Procedures 
This procedural document comprises two sections, as follows: 
• 
SECTION ONE: Procedures for managing alleged academic misconduct in coursework units 
• 
SECTION TWO: Procedures for managing alleged HDR academic misconduct in assessable work 
leading/associated to the production of thesis 
 
_________________________________________________________________________________ 
 
SECTION ONE 
 
Section one of this schedule (Schedule 3) relates to procedures for managing academic misconduct 
in coursework units. This set of procedures applies to undergraduate and postgraduate students 
including those undertaking coursework units as part of HDR candidature. It comprises five parts, as 
follows: 
Part 1 – General procedures for handling academic misconduct  
Part 2 – Specific responsibilities for handling academic misconduct cases 
