6 
Possible outcomes of EVA 
6.1 
EVA applies to the following types of assessment, except for those referred to in Section 7 of this 
policy: 
(a) in-semester assessments or continuous assessments;  
(b) centrally administered examinations; and 
(c) school-administered examinations 
6.2 
The possible outcomes of an EVA application include the following: 
(a) subject to section 6.5 of this policy, undertaking a deferred examination;  
(b) extension to an assessment deadline; 
(c) provision of a replacement or additional assessment opportunity; 
(d) permission to sit examinations away from the University; 
 
