Note on UniAccess Adjustment Plans (UAAP): 
o 
UAAPs provide students with disabilities or mental or physical health conditions that affect their 
studies with reasonable adjustments. 
o 
Students are required to provide their UCs with their UAAP if they wish to make use of the 
reasonable adjustments. 
o 
Where a student with a UAAP makes use of an extension adjustment (e.g. for a written 
assessment), the two-day penalty waiver does not apply to the extended due date – i.e. if the 
student submits after the extended deadline, the penalty applies to each day after the extended 
due date. 
 
