(1) Student Services and Engagement must:
(a) organise all supplementary, deferred formal and standard duration examinations, regardless 
of the number of students sitting the examination;
(b) provide an examination timetable to students including the times, dates and places for initial, 
supplementary and deferred examinations;
(c) notify students via email when the examination timetable is available within the 
