The suite of current and emerging generative AI tools is worth careful consideration by the 
academic, as these may be a very useful first step (depending on the discipline of deployment) 
in helping students rapidly iterate through, and refine, different ideas for their creative 
compositions. The multimodal nature of generative AI is also helpful in helping students consider 
expressing their creativity in a mode that comes most naturally with guided transformation to 
another mode of expression: for example, a student be best able to express their creativity in 
