Workshopping structure: each week of workshopping will see one or two people present, 
and one or two people facilitate. The order of presentations will be decided in the Week 
One tutorials, and your tutor will assign a week for you to facilitate.  
Step One  
• 
Statements of meaning. 
• 
Writers need to understand how the work they have produced has meaning to 
other people. 
• 
Facilitators will ask: ‘What has meaning for you in this piece? What was 
stimulating, surprising, provocative, evocative, memorable, touching, unique…?’ 
• 
All Responders answer according to their individual engagement. 
Step Two 
• 
Artist as Questioner. 
