Overview of Assessment Model 
This assessment model is centred around the creation of a comprehensive field or lab book that 
can be useful across a variety of disciplines. Initially developed for undergraduates studying the 
biological sciences, the model integrates both theory and practice captured in an experiential 
journal, drawing value from both critical observation and reflection. Excellent for use with a 
flipped classroom, this approach requires students to first prepare and revise background 
materials (e.g., online learning materials) prior to participating in the flipped environment: as 
they then progress to capturing experiential activities in their physical or digital notebooks, the 
opportunity to socialise observations with peers and/or instructor(s) provides a key opportunity 
