comprehensive report discussing their overall findings, the relationships between the 
different tasks, and the implications relative to their chosen discipline. This report should 
demonstrate a deep understanding of the subject matter, as well as the ability to 
synthesise information and identify commonalities between the assignments (e.g., the 
propagation of uncertainty in different technical scenarios). 
