component tasks as soon as possible. The emerging capabilities of data analysis within chat-
based AI tools should be approached cautiously: while these can be a powerful method to 
quickly analyse large volumes of data, lecturers may wish to advise students on the benefits of 
taking both manual and AI-automated approaches.  
With the extension concept above of deploying open-ended technical questions within the 
laboratory prompts, students may find the use of chat-based generative AI helpful, as a means 
of informal and immediate dialogue on the nature of the open-ended question (e.g., outside of 
class, or where the instructor(s) are not immediately available). As with most technical activities, 
this can help students commence work on a problem without waiting for the next opportunity 
for interaction, thereby maximising time on task.  
 
