Unique Infrastructure 
Naturally, there is a significant infrastructure requirement 
around the field trip experience itself, wherein 
opportunities for professional practice are available within 
a controllable environment. 
If the field trip involves access to non-standard teaching 
facilities (on or off campus), the coordinating academic 
must be familiar with and have completed all necessary 
risk assessment and safety documentation. 
 
