The use of generative AI tools must be approached with extreme caution for some disciplines, 
including the originating discipline of accounting: although AI tools can be useful, professional 
confidentiality expectations should be mimicked in the classroom. Where the student may have 
access to generative AI tools with enterprise-level security (i.e., that may be deployed within a 
corporation), the use of chat-based tools and extensions to explore trends in analysed or raw 
data can be a useful extension concept, particularly if the discipline does not have a significant 
existing scaffold in data analysis.  
