In-person (preferred); hybrid (optional) 
Indicative Weighting 
40% of unit mark 
Indicative Student Effort 
7 hours/week  
Indicative Marking Effort 
20 minutes/student 
Student Deliverable(s) 
500-word analysis of a community of inquiry (CoI) 
Development and presentation of a CoI 
Component Tasks 
N/A 
Unique Infrastructure 
The CoI takes place in a workshop setting, where face-to-
face is preferable. Seats arranged in a circle, with no 
desks. A trained facilitator is needed to run the inquiry, 
noting the further resources available at the end of the 
model. 
 
