are backed by their collected data. Additionally, the assignment aims to enhance students' 
abilities to communicate their findings effectively. The requirement to produce a final map, a 
cross-section, a key, and a detailed geological history encourages students to develop their 
scientific communication skills, particularly in terms of presenting complex geological data in a 
clear, concise, and comprehensive manner.  
