4. Constructive feedback: Feedback on the assignment should be timely and constructive, 
providing students with specific areas for improvement and attempting, as much as possible, 
to ensure students have early feedback in the assessment process as they build toward their 
final submission. 
Generative AI and Other Technology Considerations 
While the Model is primarily hands-on and does not rely heavily on technology, there are a few 
technology considerations that could enhance the learning experience: 
 Digital tools for field data collection: Students could use digital tools or apps to help with data 
collection in the field, such as digital compasses or GPS applications that may be built-in to 
their phones. 
 Virtual field trips: Virtual field trips could be used to supplement or replace physical field trips for 
students who cannot participate due to physical limitations. These could include 3D models or 
panoramic photos of geological sites. 
