• Tasks: The two component tasks in the Case Study Analysis model are designed to guide 
students through the process of analysing the case, making decisions, and reflecting on the 
outcomes. Their sequential nature emulates the process of dealing with a real-life scenario in 
the field, where the instructions for each task should clearly communicate the expected 
