• 
Honesty with the student when their interests run far afield of the instructor’s expertise is 
important, alongside the openness to identify colleagues at UWA who might have 
backgrounds well-suited to further recommendations for the bibliography or final essay.  
Generative AI and Other Technology Considerations 
While chat-based generative AI tools can be useful in helping students identify and explore 
different research topics, their application should be carefully considered in this assessment 
(particularly within a discipline of natural language). Instructors considering the deployment of 
generative AI should first test a variety of potential topics and lenses within the accessible tools, 
and should plan to demonstrate these use cases (and prompts) with students in the limit they are 
to be recommended in class. In particular, thought should be given to the accuracy of 
