Overview of Assessment Model 
This assessment model is an innovative approach to engaging students in a realistic and 
practical learning experience. This model is centred around the idea of a 'grant application' 
where students are tasked with developing and submitting a comprehensive proposal for a 
fictitious grant in the discipline area. The key feature of this model is its emphasis on practical 
application and real-world relevance. Rather than focusing solely on theoretical knowledge, this 
model places students in a scenario that closely mirrors professional environments, thereby 
equipping them with the skills and experience needed in the 'real world.' Through this model, 
students are encouraged to think critically and creatively, work independently, and apply their 
academic knowledge to a practical scenario. The model is suitable for disciplines where grant 
