Example Rubric – Submission 2 
This assessment deals with the design of your nominated unit(s) and their direct surroundings. For 
each piece of equipment, you will be required to list it in an equipment schedule (1 page), give the basis 
of selection, basis for the shortcut design such as residence time, heat load, throughput, product quality, 
operating P and T, etc. The shortcut design is to give the size of equipment and an outline sketch of the 
equipment showing key dimensions. 
 
Submission should be in the following form: 
Each group should submit only one complete document as before. It should include a SHORT 
introduction/summary followed by each person’s individual section. This should be clearly labelled who 
did the work per section. It must include an up to date and correctly labelled PFD and stream tables 
The document should look professional and be coherently put together. 
 
