Sensible format  
Contains relevant Information 
 
Section Title: Shortcut equipment designs to obtain sizing of equipment 
Section Weighting: 0.40 (40%) 
Description: This should include the basis of equipment selection and the basis for the shortcut design such as 
residence time, heat load, throughput, product quality, operating P and T, etc. In addition, present a calculation 
sheet (most important calculations) for each item with any references to charts, monographs or simplified 
equations. (4-page max calc sheet per equipment item - no duplication for identical items) The reference material 
(charts etc) and less important calculations can be attached as an appendix. 
Marking Criteria: 
Demonstrated research to determine equipment choice 
Relevant Calculations 
Correct critical parameters (fit for purpose) 
Demonstrated critical insight 
 
Section Title: Equipment specification sheets and outline sketch of the equipment 
Section Weighting: 0.30 (30%) 
Description: For each piece of equipment show the location of any key features such as nozzles, hatches, 
instrument connections etc. Show overall dimensions of the item. Include a side view of the equipment with any 
internal structures. 
Marking Criteria: 
Clarity of diagrams 
Relevant information on diagrams 
Amount of detail in sketches 
Inclusion of key features 
 
