Section Title: Executive Summary 
Section Weighting: 0.05 (5%) 
Description: Executive summary that describes the process design, plant capacity, major risks identified, 
economic analysis of the design (1 page maximum). 
Marking Criteria:  
Emphasises on relevant points 
Quality and relevance of recommendations 
Conciseness and succinctness 
 
Section Title: PFD and Stream Tables 
