Description: Final PFD and stream tables 
Marking Criteria: 
Quality and readability of diagram(s) 
Use of Correct sig. fig. in stream tables 
Quality and consistency of Energy input/output tables 
Readable formatting of tables 
 
Section Title: Safety and Hazard Analysis 
Section Weighting: 0.15 (15%) 
