Description: All investments carry inherent risk. In the report the threats and risk to the proposed plant must be 
discussed. This should include safety risks, economic risks, risks to physical infrastructure, external financial 
risks, risks and threats due to the operating environment (govt. regulations etc) 
Marking Criteria: 
Breadth of threats discussed 
Consistency with other sections/statements in the report 
Justification for the risks/threats discussed 
 
Section Title: Presentation 
Section Weighting: 0.10 (10%) 
Marking Criteria: 
Quality and readability of diagram/figures 
Quality of grammar and mistakes in the text 
Flow of the narrative throughout the document 
Consistency of formatting throughout the document 
 
