participants, ethical review is required for research involving Aboriginal and Torres Strait 
Islander individuals, communities or groups, concerning their cultural connections to land, 
waters, natural resources, ecologies, cultural places, sites and landscapes.
3.5
Professional Responsibility in Research
(A).
Research must be designed to respect the welfare, safety, privacy and dignity of human 
subjects and to avoid unnecessary pain and suffering to animal subjects.
