anage communications about the publication with the co-Authors and the"", ""L023"": ""editor/publisher;"", ""L024"": ""(6). disclose upfront, not retrospectively, to the University and to publishers of their"", ""L025"": ""outputs, multiple submissions of Research findings including earlier versions of the"", ""L026"": ""Research;"", ""L027"": ""(7). acknowledge funding bodies in a manner consistent with that described in the relevant"", ""L028"": ""funding agreement; and"", ""L029"": ""(8). have an ORCID identifier that is linked in the UWA Profiles and Research Repository and"", ""L030"": ""included it in all of their publications."", ""L031"": ""(G). Where there is a potential, perceived or actual Authorship dispute, this is to be dealt with in"", ""L032"": ""accordance with the Authorship and Disputes Procedure."", ""L033"": ""(H). For an individual to be recorded as an Author of a publication it will require that they are"", ""L034"": ""directly involved in the creation of the publication by —"", ""L035"": ""(1). contributing, as described in point 9 (C) above;"", ""L036"": ""The University of Western uwa.edu.au/policy 9"", ""L037"": ""Australia"", ""L038"": ""Code of Conduct Integrity Academic""}","(2).
