Research Ethics
(A).
Research involving people, animals, or Genetically Modified Organisms (GMOs), must be 
reviewed and approved first. Research Integrity Advisors can assist Researchers on these 
subjects —
(1).
Human Research Ethics – “Working with people” even includes simple things like: 
making observations about people; surveys, interviews, and focus groups;
(2).
Animal Ethics – Working with “animals” means lab animals and wildlife, vertebrates 
