l includes any person acting in the capacity of head of the school or any"", ""L025"": ""person nominated by the head to deal with a particular matter."", ""L026"": ""irregularity in marking means that the assessor, in determining the outcome of an assessment,"", ""L027"": ""standard has not taken into account relevant factors or has taken into account"", ""L028"": ""irrelevant factors."", ""L029"": ""Failed Component (FC) is a component that a student must pass in order to obtain an overall pass"", ""L030"": ""in a unit."", ""L031"": ""final grade means the letter code assigned to indicate the level of a student’s academic"", ""L032"": ""performance in a unit."", ""L033"": ""final mark means the aggregate of marks given for assessment items that contribute"", ""L034"": ""to the final result for a unit once any adjustment system has been applied."", ""L035"": ""head of school includes any person acting in the capacity of head of school or authorised"", ""L036"": ""by the head of school to deal with a particular matter."", ""L037"": ""local procedure or schedule means a University-approved procedure, schedule or other instrument that"", ""L038"": ""supports the application of this policy to an offshore campus, transnational"", ""L039"": ""education arrangement or other approved delivery location, including where"", ""L040"": ""required to comply with applicable local laws or regulatory requirements."", ""L041"": ""mark means the numerical mark or other outcome (e.g. Pass / Fail) given for an"", ""L042"": ""assessment item."", ""L043"": ""marking process means the steps taken by the assessor in calculating the mark or other"", ""L044"": ""outcome of the assessment including, but not limited to, computation or the"", ""L045"": ""allocation of total marks achievable for any component of the assessment"", ""L046"": ""item."", ""L047"": ""relevant board means a board relevant to the case in point. The relevant board may"", ""L048"": ""include a position or a body of people with authority to carry out the function"", ""L049"": ""concerned (e.g. board of examiners who are responsible for considering"", ""L050"": ""assessments made by schools)."", ""L051"": ""reasonable means logical and demonstrating sound judgement."", ""L052"": ""1""}","Approval Date: 23 September 2026 
 
