10 
External resolution 
10.1 Nothing in this policy precludes a person or the University from reporting an alleged criminal action to 
the police or another relevant authority. 
10.2 A complainant may seek resolution of their complaint through an external statutory, regulatory, law 
enforcement or other competent authority at any time. 
10.3 Where a complaint relates to an offshore campus or other approved delivery location, the relevant 
local procedure or schedule may identify applicable external complaint, reporting or regulatory 
pathways. 
