The Vice-Chancellor will submit an annual compliance report to Senate on compliance with 
delegations and sub-delegations. 
7 
Instruments of Delegation 
7.1 
Responsibility for developing, managing and reviewing the Instruments of Delegation, and making 
them available to relevant members of the University Community, is specified below (as may be 
amended from time to time and approved by the Vice-Chancellor). 
7.2 
The Instruments of Delegation must be reviewed biennially unless otherwise specified to ensure 
ongoing relevance, appropriateness and consistency with legislative requirements and the University’s 
strategic plan and policies. 
 
