8 
Power of Attorney 
8.1 
A Power of Attorney approved by the Senate may permit the signing of all documents required to be 
sealed. 
8.2 
The University Secretary must maintain a register of all documents executed under Power of Attorney 
and must seal any documents authorised by the Senate on behalf of the University. 
8.3 
A person executing a document under Power of Attorney authorised by the Senate must advise the 
University Secretary within seven days after the date on which the document was executed and 
provide a copy of the executed document. 
 
 
