2.3
Out of Scope 
(A).
This Policy does not apply to Complaints made about employment at the University.
(B).
Grievances and disputes about employment at the University are handled through the 
Employees agreements —
(1).
University of Western Australia Academic Employees Agreement;
(2).
University of Western Australia Professional and General Employees Agreement;
(3).
University of Western Australia Elicos Teachers Agreement; or
(4).
University of Western Australia Guild of Undergraduates Enterprise Bargaining 
Agreement.
(C).
This Policy does not apply to current or former Students where a Complaint is about their 
student experience. 
(D).
Complaints about student experience are received and managed under the Student 
Complaint Resolution Policy.
