(A).
Originators and Contributors of IP are encouraged to:
(1).
inform the appropriate Deputy Vice-Chancellor;
(2).
identify any co-owners of the IP; and
(3).
advise whether the co-owners wish the University to assist in the Commercialisation of 
the IP.
(B).
A Deputy Vice-Chancellor may request that Originators and Contributors:
(1).
execute any document;
(2).
do anything reasonably required by the University,
(3).
to prove ownership of IP to third parties, secure IP protection or assist the University to 
Commercialise IP.
