""6.3 Material breaches or negligence in the performance of responsibilities set out by the Cyber Security"", ""L023"": ""Framework may be considered as Misconduct and addressed through formal Misconduct Process as"", ""L024"": ""defined in the Managing Employee Misconduct Policy."", ""L025"": ""Legislative Context"", ""L026"": ""Relevant Legislation or Regulations"", ""L027"": ""University of Western Australia Act 1911 (WA)"", ""L028"": ""University of Western Australia Statute (2020)"", ""L029"": ""Western Australian Cyber Security Policy"", ""L030"": ""Australian Signals Directorate Information Security Manual"", ""L031"": ""USA National Institute of Standards and Technology Cybersecurity Framework"", ""L032"": ""End""}","(a) maintaining and communicating requirements of the Cyber Security Framework; 
(b) setting and delivery of the Cyber Security Strategy; 
