r whom enrolment in the unit does not breach any rules concerning pre-"", ""L020"": ""requisite or co-requisite or incompatible units or any rules relating to the student’s course"", ""L021"": ""(for instance, a student must take at least four Level 3 units for meeting the requirements"", ""L022"": ""of an undergraduate degree course rules)."", ""L023"": ""(iv) Where there are sound practical reasons to restrict enrolment in a unit, such as the need"", ""L024"": ""for specialised resources, the availability of facilities, or limited laboratory space, co-"", ""L025"": ""requisite rules may be used to restrict enrolment in Level 2 or Level 3 units to students"", ""L026"": ""who are seeking to complete a particular major."", ""L027"": ""(v) In exceptional circumstances, with the approval of the Academic Council on the"", ""L028"": ""recommendation of the relevant board(s), enrolment in Level 2 or Level 3 units may be"", ""L029"": ""restricted by rules that require students to have completed a particular special"", ""L030"": ""requirement, have a special aptitude and/or have attained a particular standard, such as"", ""L031"": ""achieving a particular course Grade Point Average (GPA) or course Weighted Average"", ""L032"": ""mark (WAM)."", ""L033"": ""(vi) Level 4 and Level 5 units offered in postgraduate coursework courses must be"", ""L034"": ""undertaken in accordance with the relevant course rules."", ""L035"": ""(5) Imposing a quota on a unit:"", ""L036"": ""(a) Entry to units is not restricted by way of quotas where avoidable. Where high numbers pose a"", ""L037"": ""challenge, Heads of School are expected to make flexible arrangements wherever possible,"", ""L038"": ""such as scheduling repeat classes and considering alternative modes of delivery."", ""L039"": ""(b) Student quotas may only be imposed on enrolments in specific units when specific relevant"", ""L040"": ""conditions warrant their imposition. These conditions normally fall within one of the following"", ""L041"": ""categories:"", ""L042"": ""(i) constrained specialist learning spaces (e.g. laboratory or studio space);"", ""L043"": ""(ii) restricted student placements (e.g. clinical training placements);"", ""L044"": ""(iii) supervision of dissertations, theses, or off-campus fieldwork; or"", ""L045"": ""(iv) occupational health and safety considerations."", ""L046"": ""(c) Unit quotas are not normally applied to Level 1 units or core units in any course. The impact of"", ""L047"": ""imposing a quota must be considered and take into account students’ ability to progress"", ""L048"": ""through their course(s) in a timely manner, as well as the ability of students to meet pre-"", ""L049"": ""requisites and co-requisites and to complete their courses and graduate without delay."", ""L050"": ""(d) A quota cannot be imposed on a unit any later than the opening of enrolments for the relevant"", ""L051"": ""academic year."", ""L052"": ""(e) The relevant board(s) may approve the introduction or change of a quota."", ""L053"": ""(6) Making units unavailable in a calendar year:"", ""L054"": ""(a) The Head of School may approve a request for a unit to be made unavailable in a calendar"", ""L055"": ""year where there are unforeseen circumstances (e.g. damage to facilities or equipment); the"", ""L056"": ""minimum enrolment numbers as advertised have not been reached; or the unit is only taught"", ""L057"": ""in alternate years."", ""L058"": ""(b) A unit must not be made unavailable in a calendar year where the proposed unavailability"", ""L059"": ""unduly impacts students' ability to undertake the relevant requirements of an undergraduate"", ""L060"": ""6""}","conform to the University's standard semester dates require the approval of the relevant 
