(5) 
A Special General Meeting requested under clause 22(2) must be held within 28 University 
Working Days after the date on which the request is received. 
 
General Meetings: notice and quorum 
(1) 
The Council must give Members written notice of a General Meeting at least 15 University 
Working Days before the date of the meeting and in accordance with clause 17. 
(2) 
Notice of a General Meeting may also be given by any additional means accessible to 
Members as determined by the Warden. 
(3) 
Notice of a General Meeting must state — 
