Elections of Elected members if conducted by the Council 
(1) 
In this clause — 
 
 
Returning Officer means the Returning Officer appointed under clause 54(6).  
(2) 
This clause applies to an election of an Elected member by the Council under clause 31(1)(b) 
or 31(7). 
How elections are held 
(3) 
If an election is to be held at a Council Meeting, that must be stated in the notice of the 
meeting (the notice) and the notice must be published — 
(a) 
on the Convocation website; and 
(b) 
in any other manner the Council considers necessary in order to bring it to the 
attention of Members. 
(4) 
The notice must specify the day on or before which nominations for the election must be 
received (the nomination day).  
