Awareness sessions, briefings, or presentations; and 
iv. 
Updates to relevant webpages and documentation. 
(b) The Policy Secretariat and Corporate Communications teams can assist Policy Owners in 
preparing and scheduling communications to ensure consistent messaging and reach across the 
University. 
7.2 
