cy Feedback Form."", ""L048"": ""6.5 Consideration"", ""L049"": ""(a) All feedback received must be properly recorded, collated and considered in good faith."", ""L050"": ""(b) The Policy Owner must analyse the feedback and prepare a response to the key themes that"", ""L051"": ""emerge."", ""L052"": ""(c) Where particular suggestions are not adopted, reasons must be documented. This stage ensures"", ""L053"": ""that consultation is not treated as a perfunctory step, but as a genuine opportunity to influence""}","(a) Transparency: stakeholders are provided with clear and accessible information about the 
proposed change, including its rationale and likely impact. 
