4.2 
Information Breaches, including suspected breaches, must be identified and reported as soon as 
practicable after they are detected to enable prompt assessment and response. 
(a) In the event of an actual or suspected information breach, members of the University Community 
(other than third parties engaged by the University under a contract for services) must 
immediately: 
• 
Report to University IT via (+61) 8 6488 1234 or emailing servicedesk@uwa.edu.au when 
immediate response and containment measures are required; and 
• 
Report the information breach to the UWA Privacy Office via the University’s Privacy 
website or by emailing privacy@uwa.edu.au. 
 
