Code of Conduct
Inclusion and Diversity
Administrative
Procedure —
A. UniAccess Disability Office can provide advice, assistance and support to Students with 
disability or medical condition. Registering with UniAccess can streamline processes for 
accommodating a mental health problem or illness.
B. Accommodations such as Special Consideration allows faculties to take into account significant 
and unforseen factors that may have affected a Student's performance. Special consideration 
allows a faculty to make informed and fair decisions concerning a Student's academic 
progress including decisions around extensions for assignments, withdrawal or course 
changes, determining final grades in a unit of study, or approval of deferred examinations.
